  "description": "A burst water pipe, skyrocketing rent, and a cheating boyfriend. Not a single thing is going right. On a whim, Yi-Seon brings a drunk man sleeping on the street back to her place to let him sleep over. It turns out he’s a junior in his department at university, comes from a wealthy family, and has a secret crush on him…?!\n\n*“We’ve been living together, and now you’re suddenly regretting that you never got to sleep with me?”*\n\n“Yeah.”\n\nA mysterious man bursts into the daily life of college student “Na Yi-seon,” whose life motto is “Safety First”!! A crazy romance between a psycho beauty and a junk car collector!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
